HOPE Labs: the launcher for the HOPE Lab's tools, and HOPE-flow
Copyright (c) 2026, Sandun Fernando, HOPE Lab, Texas A&M University. Authored by Aadhil Haq, Samavath Mallawarachchi and Lasan Manujitha. All rights reserved.

This software is not open source. No licence to use, copy, modify or
distribute it is granted to anyone outside the HOPE Lab without written
permission from Dr. Sandun Fernando.

It is a launcher: it signs in to Texas A&M's clusters, starts the lab's tools
there and draws them as a flow. It implements none of the methods those tools
run. Each tool keeps its own licence and its own notices, and the terms of one
of them reach this launcher: BindCraft2 may not be offered to third parties as
a hosted service, so giving anyone outside the group this launcher, or a page
it serves, would breach that tool's licence rather than this one.

The third-party programs and libraries it uses keep their own licences; see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Contact: Dr. Sandun Fernando (sfernando@tamu.edu), Aadhil Haq (aadhil.haq@tamu.edu).
